{
  "slug": "backend-security-skills",
  "name": "Backend Security Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Security auditor for Node.js and Python backend APIs. Four skills cover pre-audit reconnaissance (route graph, auth matrix, invariants), static code audit across the OWASP API Security Top 10 via 8 parallel agents (authz / authn / injection / deserialization-and-ssrf / crypto-and-secrets / resource-and-business-logic / config-and-supply-chain / llm-and-integration), and live HTTP probing that verifies findings with reproducible curl transcripts. Outputs markdown or JSON with severity + CWE + OWASP API Top 10 tags per finding. Built for Express, NestJS, Fastify, Koa, Next.js, FastAPI, Django, Flask, and Starlette.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `api-recon` (Generates an api-recon/ folder containing a pre-audit reconnaissance report for a backend API), `nodejs-api-auditor` (Security audit of Node.js backend APIs while you develop), `python-api-auditor` (Security audit of Python backend APIs while you develop), `runtime-audit` (Dynamic security testing for running backend APIs)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install backend-security-skills@claude-community` from `souzavinny/backend-security-skills` (`plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
